<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - People's Bank upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - People's Bank upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Nancy Hazelrigg upgraded People's Bank (Bridgeport, Conn.) to near-term accumulate from neutral.</p>
<p>-- kept the long-term rating at buy.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares rose 2-1/4 to 32-1/8.</p>
</text>
